{"tier": "glm-5.2", "verse": 9, "ref": "judges 14:9", "book": "judges", "lang": "ms", "chapter": 14, "translation": "Dikeroknya madu itu ke dalam telapak tangannya, lalu berjalan sambil makan, dan pergi kepada bapanya dan kepada ibunya, diberikannya kepada mereka, dan mereka makan; tetapi tidak diberitahukannya kepada mereka bahawa dari bangkai singa itu dikeroknya madu itu.", "tokens": [{"surface": "וירדהו", "gloss": "dikeroknya"}, {"surface": "אל", "gloss": "ke dalam"}, {"surface": "כפיו", "gloss": "telapak tangannya"}, {"surface": "וילך", "gloss": "lalu berjalan"}, {"surface": "הלוך", "gloss": "sambil berjalan"}, {"surface": "ואכל", "gloss": "sambil makan"}, {"surface": "וילך", "gloss": "dan pergi"}, {"surface": "אל", "gloss": "kepada"}, {"surface": "אביו", "gloss": "bapanya"}, {"surface": "ואל", "gloss": "dan kepada"}, {"surface": "אמו", "gloss": "ibunya"}, {"surface": "ויתן", "gloss": "diberikannya"}, {"surface": "להם", "gloss": "kepada mereka"}, {"surface": "ויאכלו", "gloss": "dan mereka makan"}, {"surface": "ולא", "gloss": "tetapi tidak"}, {"surface": "הגיד", "gloss": "diberitahukannya"}, {"surface": "להם", "gloss": "kepada mereka"}, {"surface": "כי", "gloss": "bahawa"}, {"surface": "מגוית", "gloss": "dari bangkai"}, {"surface": "האריה", "gloss": "singa itu"}, {"surface": "רדה", "gloss": "dikeroknya"}, {"surface": "הדבש", "gloss": "madu itu"}], "timestamp": "2026-09-04T12:09:18.559874531Z", "model": "glm-5.3"}